        "original_id": "b16bb262-896d-5304-a18b-b0cd9ce4240c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Splash!\n- People: Tom Daley\n- Topics: British television, diving, 10-metre platform\n\nFacts:\n- Splash! is a British television show that teaches celebrities the art of diving with the aid of Tom Daley.\n- Tom Daley, whose full name is Thomas Robert Daley, was born on 21 May 1994 and is a British diver.\n- Tom Daley specialises in the 10-metre platform event.\n- Tom Daley won the 2009 FINA World Championship individual 10-metre platform title at age 15.\n- Tom Daley regained the World Championship title in the 10-metre platform event in 2017.\n- Tom Daley is a double World champion in the 10-metre platform event.",
